setup_new='store.begin();eventStateBegin();loadPinAuthConfig();customFsReady=storageHealthCheck();if(customFsReady){migrateLegacyCustomStorage();runPaletteColorMigration();migrateMasterCalendarV1();settingsBackupInitialize();}seedMasterSceneFavoritesV4();'
