ag=ag.replace('Legacy Gradient ID 3 may remain reserved for backward compatibility but must never be offered or assigned; legacy Gradient assignments migrate to Breath.','Legacy Gradient ID 3 may remain reserved for backward compatibility but must never be offered or assigned; retired/unknown legacy effect names map to Jump. Breath is a supported selectable effect but is not assigned automatically to built-in events.')
